# Sango II Translation Rules

- Doc `docs/HUONG-DAN-VIET-TAT.md` truoc khi dich.
- Moi entry JSON: dien `translated` (day du) va `abbrev` (trong game).
- `abbrev` chi dung ASCII a-z A-Z 0-9 space — KHONG dau tieng Viet.
- Bat buoc: `len(abbrev) <= ascii_max`.
- Giu nguyen `id`, `offset`, `raw_hex`, `file`, `category` — chi sua translated/abbrev/status.
- `status`: "pending" | "sample" | "done"
- Ten tuong/dia danh dong bo voi bang viet tat co dinh.

Vi du:
- original: 劉備, ascii_max: 6 -> abbrev: "Luu Bi"
- original: 請選擇所扮演的新君主, ascii_max: 12 -> abbrev: "Chon quan chu"

Commit message: `dich name.json: batch 1`
